[docker_build_env] Chang-log

[v1.0.1] - [May 12th, 2025]

[Description]
    Update the docker image and provide an environment for compiling the uboot of the fanke vendor board.

[Release Notes]
    - The password for user fanke is "fanke".
    - You can use "sudo apt" to install more packages.
    - The mirror source used is the Tsinghua mirror source. If you need to restore the default, please operate manually.
    - If you need to compile the image yourself, you can use the provided Dockerfile.

